{title: Cordero Santiago}
{key: Am}
{meta: category Cordero}

{comment: Intro}
[Am] [G] [Am] [G]

{start_of_verse}
[Am]Este es el cor[G]dero de [Am]Dios [G]
[Am]Este es el cor[G]dero de [C]Dios
Que qu[Dm]ita el pecado del [Am]mundo
[F]Cordero de Di[E]os ten [Am]piedad
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
